(604061, 62614, 14952, '<td valign="top">Although I''m guessing you''ll get slammed because there isn''t actually any fire in this, I liked the idea and thought about it myself.  I like the shot, but there seems to be too little going on on the top and the left.  Perhaps a crop of the lower right part would have helped a little more</td>', 'Although I''m guessing you''ll get slammed because there isn''t actually any fire in this, I liked the idea and thought about it myself.  I like the shot, but there seems to be too little going on on the top and the left.  Perhaps a crop of the lower right part would have helped a little more', '2004-03-01 00:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(604063, 62359, 14952, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Why didn''t I think of this!  I love it.  The eye on the left feels a bit cut off to me and the shot overall feels a bit unbalanced.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Why didn''t I think of this!  I love it.  The eye on the left feels a bit cut off to me and the shot overall feels a bit unbalanced.', '2004-03-01 00:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
