(604337, 62759, 8159, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter, but unfortunately your attempt at removing the background in the upper left hand corner is very obvious and I think it ends up detracting from the picture. My other suggestion (since the theme of this challenge was "Fire") would be to focus on the region where the flame is instead of on the igniter.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter, but unfortunately your attempt at removing the background in the upper left hand corner is very obvious and I think it ends up detracting from the picture. My other suggestion (since the theme of this challenge was "Fire") would be to focus on the region where the flame is instead of on the igniter.', '2004-03-01 08:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(604360, 62725, 14401, '<td valign="top">''K, so my idea wasn''t entirely unique!  I thought of doing my shot this way as well, but I didn''t have an old burner to burn, LOL.  Nice job!</td>', '''K, so my idea wasn''t entirely unique!  I thought of doing my shot this way as well, but I didn''t have an old burner to burn, LOL.  Nice job!', '2004-03-01 09:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
