(604362, 62725, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice visual pun. I think you could have used more ambient light perhaps - just to amphasise that tower a touch more.</td>', 'Nice visual pun. I think you could have used more ambient light perhaps - just to amphasise that tower a touch more.', '2004-03-01 09:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(604363, 62398, 6999, '<td valign="top">Framing is a little weak for me - I''m not convinced about where you''ve decided to cut off the plug. The spark itself is of course indistinct, too, and has little impact really - one of those things that just doesn''t look as good as perhaps you thought it might.</td>', 'Framing is a little weak for me - I''m not convinced about where you''ve decided to cut off the plug. The spark itself is of course indistinct, too, and has little impact really - one of those things that just doesn''t look as good as perhaps you thought it might.', '2004-03-01 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(604366, 62371, 6999, '<td valign="top">To be convincing as a trick shot i think you need the sparks to be originating at the point of the electrodes - and also here they''re very obviously all behind the plug, rather than emanating from it. The amount of light on the plug itself is too much also - emphasises the searation between the sparks and the plug, rather than bringing it together in a convincing image.</td>', 'To be convincing as a trick shot i think you need the sparks to be originating at the point of the electrodes - and also here they''re very obviously all behind the plug, rather than emanating from it. The amount of light on the plug itself is too much also - emphasises the searation between the sparks and the plug, rather than bringing it together in a convincing image.', '2004-03-01 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
