(605659, 62445, 16982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is you''re burning there, but you have definitely managed to produce a beautiful shot from it.  The "texture" of the blue part of the flame might blend better with the rest of the picture if it was blurred out, though.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is you''re burning there, but you have definitely managed to produce a beautiful shot from it.  The "texture" of the blue part of the flame might blend better with the rest of the picture if it was blurred out, though.', '2004-03-02 12:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(605662, 62569, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good timing! To steady the match, line up the camera, focus AND take the shot all before the match head had blackened is a feat in itself.  Getting closer, if your camera allows it, might have been preferable.</td>', 'Good timing! To steady the match, line up the camera, focus AND take the shot all before the match head had blackened is a feat in itself.  Getting closer, if your camera allows it, might have been preferable.', '2004-03-02 12:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(605667, 62392, 16982, '<td valign="top">Nice colour here. A tad blurry but that was unavoidable.  There is also a dark line approximately 400-425 pixels from the left and 320-350 pixels from the top that is a bit distracting.  Well done for not burning your camera!</td>', 'Nice colour here. A tad blurry but that was unavoidable.  There is also a dark line approximately 400-425 pixels from the left and 320-350 pixels from the top that is a bit distracting.  Well done for not burning your camera!', '2004-03-02 12:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
