(605769, 62823, 4008, '<td valign="top">Really wondering how you did this using only one image (I see it has been validated). The only thing I can think of is that the flames were in e.g. the top left corner and then moved to the hand using cloning. The idea is good but the image is still not very appealing to me, which is a main factor in my voting. 7 for now.</td>', 'Really wondering how you did this using only one image (I see it has been validated). The only thing I can think of is that the flames were in e.g. the top left corner and then moved to the hand using cloning. The idea is good but the image is still not very appealing to me, which is a main factor in my voting. 7 for now.', '2004-03-02 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
