(605791, 62589, 15207, '<td valign="top">Hey! Cool shot. I like that you took the time to submit something with good composition in addition to a great title. I also like that your shot is crisp. Too many fire images in this challenge are blurry.</td>', 'Hey! Cool shot. I like that you took the time to submit something with good composition in addition to a great title. I also like that your shot is crisp. Too many fire images in this challenge are blurry.', '2004-03-02 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
