(605795, 62749, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The shot is sharp and crisp too -- far too many in this challenge aren''t. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this one. The shot is sharp and crisp too -- far too many in this challenge aren''t. Good luck!', '2004-03-02 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
