(607388, 62811, 5792, '<td valign="top">Lighting and composition is very good here. The digital "jaggies" at the top of the image are a bit of a distraction and hurt the overall quality of this fine photograph. Those digital artifacts can be smoothed out using about a 5 pixel brush with a blur tool in post processing. That would make the image even better than it already is.</td>', 'Lighting and composition is very good here. The digital "jaggies" at the top of the image are a bit of a distraction and hurt the overall quality of this fine photograph. Those digital artifacts can be smoothed out using about a 5 pixel brush with a blur tool in post processing. That would make the image even better than it already is.', '2004-03-03 11:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(607420, 62119, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. If you select just the sky you could brighten the aurora 20-30% or so and apply some noise reduction to it and you could make a much more dramatic sky without washing out the nice city lights below.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. If you select just the sky you could brighten the aurora 20-30% or so and apply some noise reduction to it and you could make a much more dramatic sky without washing out the nice city lights below.', '2004-03-03 11:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
