(609466, 62303, 11570, '<td valign="top">I like the counterbalance of the dark area to the gas flame and with the "flash" of orange/amber you just gave it that certain something.<br/> <br/>However, IMHO it does need that bit of sharpening to add to the wow factor.</td>', 'I like the counterbalance of the dark area to the gas flame and with the "flash" of orange/amber you just gave it that certain something. However, IMHO it does need that bit of sharpening to add to the wow factor.', '2004-03-04 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
