(609779, 62287, 3569, '<td valign="top">Cool fireworks...</td>', 'Cool fireworks...', '2004-03-04 17:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(609881, 62783, 7628, '<td valign="top">Novel idea, well executed.  I think this photo really stands out in this challenge.  I like the flames, but little details like the texture on the line between shadow and light really make it good.  blue background is a nic contrast with the orange flames. 10</td>', 'Novel idea, well executed.  I think this photo really stands out in this challenge.  I like the flames, but little details like the texture on the line between shadow and light really make it good.  blue background is a nic contrast with the orange flames. 10', '2004-03-04 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(609888, 62749, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Isn''t there a pepper flavored vodka?  I like the blue and the dramatic gradient of the background.  Wish the line of the table was''nt slightly tilted, and the silvery label, is it? it is a bit distracting.  Nice flames, nice work with the glass. 8</td>', 'Nice idea.  Isn''t there a pepper flavored vodka?  I like the blue and the dramatic gradient of the background.  Wish the line of the table was''nt slightly tilted, and the silvery label, is it? it is a bit distracting.  Nice flames, nice work with the glass. 8', '2004-03-04 19:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(609890, 62475, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette of the structure, nice composition, the fire is effective as the only ''warm'' color in the shot. Some noise in the sky but I dont think it distracts too much.</td>', 'Good silhouette of the structure, nice composition, the fire is effective as the only ''warm'' color in the shot. Some noise in the sky but I dont think it distracts too much.', '2004-03-04 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(609891, 62559, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  I like the diagonal of the words,- they give motion to the curling burnt edges of the paper.  Wish there were a bit more flame, but I do like the subtle glow of the paper as it smolders. 9</td>', 'This is fun.  I like the diagonal of the words,- they give motion to the curling burnt edges of the paper.  Wish there were a bit more flame, but I do like the subtle glow of the paper as it smolders. 9', '2004-03-04 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(609894, 62399, 6008, '<td valign="top">The gradient of the background is good and a nice tall flame with interesting color. There is something about the rock that I do not like, but I cant really put my finger on it. Overall it''s a good shot.</td>', 'The gradient of the background is good and a nice tall flame with interesting color. There is something about the rock that I do not like, but I cant really put my finger on it. Overall it''s a good shot.', '2004-03-04 19:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(609896, 62750, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting to use a flame to represent a tear.  It is the perfect shape, and the blue gas colored flame reminds one of a watery cartoon tear.  The yellow/orange glow from inside the skull and illuminating the skull is a nice contract in color.  Wish it were deeper focus, and a little sharper overall. 7</td>', 'Interesting to use a flame to represent a tear.  It is the perfect shape, and the blue gas colored flame reminds one of a watery cartoon tear.  The yellow/orange glow from inside the skull and illuminating the skull is a nice contract in color.  Wish it were deeper focus, and a little sharper overall. 7', '2004-03-04 19:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(609897, 62613, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea with mixing the mystery of the mask with the fire - gives it a somewhat mythical feel.</td>', 'Interesting idea with mixing the mystery of the mask with the fire - gives it a somewhat mythical feel.', '2004-03-04 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(609900, 62819, 6008, '<td valign="top">Having the second lick of flame in the back helps this image a lot, it gives it some depth. It is indeed a ''warm'' image.</td>', 'Having the second lick of flame in the back helps this image a lot, it gives it some depth. It is indeed a ''warm'' image.', '2004-03-04 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(609903, 62359, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this composition - the eye in one corner and the arch of the eyebrow diagonally opposite.  Catching the reflection of the fire in the eyes is a great idea.  It comes off as a bit too subtle - I would like to see more fire - like the reflection from a fireplace. 6</td>', 'I like this composition - the eye in one corner and the arch of the eyebrow diagonally opposite.  Catching the reflection of the fire in the eyes is a great idea.  It comes off as a bit too subtle - I would like to see more fire - like the reflection from a fireplace. 6', '2004-03-04 19:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(609904, 62730, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract shapes and beautiful colors.  Maybe cropping closer would draw the viewer in better, right now it is just so much black.</td>', 'I like the abstract shapes and beautiful colors.  Maybe cropping closer would draw the viewer in better, right now it is just so much black.', '2004-03-04 19:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(609905, 62289, 6008, '<td valign="top">The eyes tend to naturally go to the brightest element in a shot and in this case it''s the large white streak in the upper left corner. The diagonal tilt composition is interesting, almost looks like a rocket. I like the flames in the lower glasses, the mix of yellow/blue blends well and is pleasing to see, but the upper flame just seems like an overexposed blur that doesnt really add much due to the lact of details and a dominance of the shot.</td>', 'The eyes tend to naturally go to the brightest element in a shot and in this case it''s the large white streak in the upper left corner. The diagonal tilt composition is interesting, almost looks like a rocket. I like the flames in the lower glasses, the mix of yellow/blue blends well and is pleasing to see, but the upper flame just seems like an overexposed blur that doesnt really add much due to the lact of details and a dominance of the shot.', '2004-03-04 19:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(609906, 62392, 6008, '<td valign="top">A classic shot but not quite the classic composition. Looks like a little camera shake on the bottom of the flames but I think it blends in with the whole mood of the shot. An interesting abstract.</td>', 'A classic shot but not quite the classic composition. Looks like a little camera shake on the bottom of the flames but I think it blends in with the whole mood of the shot. An interesting abstract.', '2004-03-04 19:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(609907, 62119, 7628, '<td valign="top">What good fortune - or perhaps more an example of persistence and patience on your part.  A lovely diagonal wave of northern lights hanging over the city - with the moon in a perfect spot.  I like the stars peeking through.  Would make a lovely poster.  Wish there was a bit more contrast between the green and the night sky. 9</td>', 'What good fortune - or perhaps more an example of persistence and patience on your part.  A lovely diagonal wave of northern lights hanging over the city - with the moon in a perfect spot.  I like the stars peeking through.  Would make a lovely poster.  Wish there was a bit more contrast between the green and the night sky. 9', '2004-03-04 19:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(609909, 62430, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the marshmallow is framed by the bright flame.  The scorch mark on the front gives some nice contrast.  7</td>', 'I like how the marshmallow is framed by the bright flame.  The scorch mark on the front gives some nice contrast.  7', '2004-03-04 19:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(609910, 62651, 6008, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I like the ''plume'' of orange and the streaks of light also add interest. Not sure what it is, but I dont think that really matters. Only nitpick is wishing that the streaks didnt end off the frame.</td>', 'Fun shot. I like the ''plume'' of orange and the streaks of light also add interest. Not sure what it is, but I dont think that really matters. Only nitpick is wishing that the streaks didnt end off the frame.', '2004-03-04 19:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(609913, 62700, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the texture you got in the match head - then the sweep of the flame is amazing!  What a composition! Wish there was a bit more detail in the flame - so much of it is white. 9</td>', 'I like the texture you got in the match head - then the sweep of the flame is amazing!  What a composition! Wish there was a bit more detail in the flame - so much of it is white. 9', '2004-03-04 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(609915, 62339, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is good but the flame is a little overexposed. A slightly darker image would maybe have helped add some detail in the flame and also darkened the background some, which looks kinda streaky. Else you could have moved the lamp farther away from the background so it didnt show as much.</td>', 'Composition is good but the flame is a little overexposed. A slightly darker image would maybe have helped add some detail in the flame and also darkened the background some, which looks kinda streaky. Else you could have moved the lamp farther away from the background so it didnt show as much.', '2004-03-04 19:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(609916, 62423, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and unexpected shape.  Almost looks like a waist covered with a folded material.  Good eye to catch this and compose it this way. 8</td>', 'A very interesting and unexpected shape.  Almost looks like a waist covered with a folded material.  Good eye to catch this and compose it this way. 8', '2004-03-04 19:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(609948, 62240, 6900, '<td valign="top">Border kills the picture - but WOW.</td>', 'Border kills the picture - but WOW.', '2004-03-04 19:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(609953, 62583, 6900, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Interesting border too.</td>', 'Cute.  Interesting border too.', '2004-03-04 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(609979, 62728, 6900, '<td valign="top">edit comment removed per your wishes<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 12:54:44.</i></td>', 'edit comment removed per your wishes', '2004-03-04 20:05:25.000000', '2005-10-05 13:54:44.000000', 1),
(610082, 62423, 6600, '<td valign="top">Resembles glass, nice abstract flame job, good luck.</td>', 'Resembles glass, nice abstract flame job, good luck.', '2004-03-04 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(610083, 62221, 8624, '<td valign="top">This might have been a nice photo at one time. I like the angle of the composition and the positioning of the burner in the frame, but the filter effects just don''t do it for me.</td>', 'This might have been a nice photo at one time. I like the angle of the composition and the positioning of the burner in the frame, but the filter effects just don''t do it for me.', '2004-03-04 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(610086, 62595, 6600, '<td valign="top">What''s being questioned in this shot?  Nice capture, the smoke is a neat touch, good color and lighting, nice composition.</td>', 'What''s being questioned in this shot?  Nice capture, the smoke is a neat touch, good color and lighting, nice composition.', '2004-03-04 21:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(610088, 62314, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting effect, nice color tones.  Good job.</td>', 'Neat lighting effect, nice color tones.  Good job.', '2004-03-04 21:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(610092, 62725, 6600, '<td valign="top">I suppose you had to make this a rather fast exposure, no?  Good job.</td>', 'I suppose you had to make this a rather fast exposure, no?  Good job.', '2004-03-04 21:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(610096, 62651, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat fire trails and colors.  Nice job. - I can''t tell what is responsible for the fire (without title).</td>', 'Neat fire trails and colors.  Nice job. - I can''t tell what is responsible for the fire (without title).', '2004-03-04 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610101, 62666, 6600, '<td valign="top">I thought we were instructed not to resort to arson! .... Kidding aside, I hope everyone involved in this fire were safe and sound.</td>', 'I thought we were instructed not to resort to arson! .... Kidding aside, I hope everyone involved in this fire were safe and sound.', '2004-03-04 22:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(610106, 62347, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and clarity, very accurate looking colors, nice job!</td>', 'Great sharpness and clarity, very accurate looking colors, nice job!', '2004-03-04 22:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(610108, 62287, 6600, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, even has a mushroom...  Nice color, good luck.</td>', 'Interesting shot, even has a mushroom...  Nice color, good luck.', '2004-03-04 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(610109, 62200, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the way the base became illuminated by the fire, nice color and composition.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the way the base became illuminated by the fire, nice color and composition.  Good job!', '2004-03-04 22:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(610114, 62823, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, great color, exposure, and composition.  Should do well!  (double exposure I presume)</td>', 'Nicely done, great color, exposure, and composition.  Should do well!  (double exposure I presume)', '2004-03-04 22:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(610120, 62333, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice idea....  I would have liked to see a brighter white on the marshmallow (maybe a bump in brightness and contrast would have done the trick).  It looks to be cooked just about right for eating... hurry!  Blow it out!</td>', 'Nice idea....  I would have liked to see a brighter white on the marshmallow (maybe a bump in brightness and contrast would have done the trick).  It looks to be cooked just about right for eating... hurry!  Blow it out!', '2004-03-04 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(610123, 62536, 6600, '<td valign="top">Spooky, rather dark, sinister looking, I might have titled it "Bad Ash".....  Good luck!</td>', 'Spooky, rather dark, sinister looking, I might have titled it "Bad Ash".....  Good luck!', '2004-03-04 22:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(610128, 62749, 18068, '<td valign="top">This is simply amazing. I can acctually imagine my buddie Dimitri crying if he ever layed his eyes on this one. Beautiful background and lighting source, well done.</td>', 'This is simply amazing. I can acctually imagine my buddie Dimitri crying if he ever layed his eyes on this one. Beautiful background and lighting source, well done.', '2004-03-04 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(610129, 62703, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good zoooooooooom lens..... a departure from the conventional fires, good job.</td>', 'Good zoooooooooom lens..... a departure from the conventional fires, good job.', '2004-03-04 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(610132, 62770, 18068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I would acctually buy this photograph and have it nicely framed and hung in my room. Its so modern, so creative, its so me.</td>', 'Beautiful. I would acctually buy this photograph and have it nicely framed and hung in my room. Its so modern, so creative, its so me.', '2004-03-04 22:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(610155, 62814, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, almost looks like a star. I personally find it a little too centered and think it would have more dramatic effect in a corner or on a third line.</td>', 'Interesting idea, almost looks like a star. I personally find it a little too centered and think it would have more dramatic effect in a corner or on a third line.', '2004-03-04 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(610172, 62445, 17203, '<td valign="top">I like the blue glow on this one, and the forms are very sculptural. The small flame on the right helps to balance the composition, too. Given that this is on a liquid, I''d like to see more of the reflection below- maybe a vertical crop? Nice job.</td>', 'I like the blue glow on this one, and the forms are very sculptural. The small flame on the right helps to balance the composition, too. Given that this is on a liquid, I''d like to see more of the reflection below- maybe a vertical crop? Nice job.', '2004-03-04 23:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(610176, 62703, 17203, '<td valign="top">Uh, no. Ionized gas glowing from intense radiation does not constitute fire to me. A tighter crop could have hidden the severe vignetting around the edges, too. I will concede that this is a better deep sky photo than I''ve been able to muster, though.  ;-)</td>', 'Uh, no. Ionized gas glowing from intense radiation does not constitute fire to me. A tighter crop could have hidden the severe vignetting around the edges, too. I will concede that this is a better deep sky photo than I''ve been able to muster, though.  ;-)', '2004-03-04 23:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(610178, 62617, 17203, '<td valign="top">Oooooh.... purty colors. I like the color and composition; don''t care for the blown-out white spots and foreground focus. This is a tough one- technically flawed but visually appealing.</td>', 'Oooooh.... purty colors. I like the color and composition; don''t care for the blown-out white spots and foreground focus. This is a tough one- technically flawed but visually appealing.', '2004-03-04 23:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(610180, 62583, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute. You could have saved yourself the trouble of the little flags in the background though, they distract from your clever idea.</td>', 'Cute. You could have saved yourself the trouble of the little flags in the background though, they distract from your clever idea.', '2004-03-04 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(610181, 62411, 17203, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but shooting fire is a lot tougher than shooting a sunset, hence you''ve dodged the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty, but shooting fire is a lot tougher than shooting a sunset, hence you''ve dodged the challenge.', '2004-03-04 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(610182, 62810, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice use of negative space and light.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice use of negative space and light.', '2004-03-04 23:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(610184, 62411, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is really a fantastic photo. I love the composition &amp; the colours. I don;t, however, think that this hot fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'this is really a fantastic photo. I love the composition & the colours. I don;t, however, think that this hot fits the challenge very well.', '2004-03-04 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
