(610228, 62750, 15305, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, nice drop effect with the flame.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, nice drop effect with the flame.', '2004-03-05 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(610229, 62434, 17203, '<td valign="top">For poaching fish? Interesting idea, and I like the fish-shaped flame. Might have been even better with a (flame colored) red lure and a darker background for contrast.</td>', 'For poaching fish? Interesting idea, and I like the fish-shaped flame. Might have been even better with a (flame colored) red lure and a darker background for contrast.', '2004-03-05 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(610233, 62778, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original take on challenge.  I see a couple of issues.  First is your focus is quite soft.  I''m not sure if you were trying for that effect or what camera you have.  I know I sometimes have a hard time with my P&amp;S camera in darker conditions trying to get a good focus.  Your colors seem a little off.  THis may be a white balance issue.  Again, depending on your camera this may or may not be easy to fix.  Also, your colors seem to be a little flat.  I would first say that a lot of light would help this issue, but would defeat the purpose of the shot.  Playing around with levels in PS can help also.  Nice composition and framing.  Keep trying the tough shots!<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting and original take on challenge.  I see a couple of issues.  First is your focus is quite soft.  I''m not sure if you were trying for that effect or what camera you have.  I know I sometimes have a hard time with my P&S camera in darker conditions trying to get a good focus.  Your colors seem a little off.  THis may be a white balance issue.  Again, depending on your camera this may or may not be easy to fix.  Also, your colors seem to be a little flat.  I would first say that a lot of light would help this issue, but would defeat the purpose of the shot.  Playing around with levels in PS can help also.  Nice composition and framing.  Keep trying the tough shots!TC', '2004-03-05 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(610234, 62323, 9906, '<td valign="top">I pride myself on having a monitor calibrated for darker shots, but I truly can not tell what exactly I''m supposed to be seing here.  Your title doesn''t help too much either.<br/>TC</td>', 'I pride myself on having a monitor calibrated for darker shots, but I truly can not tell what exactly I''m supposed to be seing here.  Your title doesn''t help too much either.TC', '2004-03-05 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(610235, 62570, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Hope this was a training run...  Not sure I like the selective desaturation in this instance, but it is effective.  I will have to look at this one again and maybe adjust your score!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot.  Hope this was a training run...  Not sure I like the selective desaturation in this instance, but it is effective.  I will have to look at this one again and maybe adjust your score!TC', '2004-03-05 00:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610236, 62475, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  I would have tried a shot like this for the challenge, but the closest refinery (an hour north of me) closed down a year ago and is now totaly gone (nothing but rubble...)<br/>TC</td>', 'Very good shot.  I would have tried a shot like this for the challenge, but the closest refinery (an hour north of me) closed down a year ago and is now totaly gone (nothing but rubble...)TC', '2004-03-05 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(610239, 62557, 9906, '<td valign="top">Because this is a tall shot (and I didn''t expand my browser) I had to scroll up and down a little to get all the shot.  Doing this, I accidently noticed that if you crop just under the 4 lights at the top, you end up with a MUCH more potent shot!  This does cut off the taller ''ghosts'' head, but it still has more ''pop''!   I''m not a big fan of the ''ghost'' images but this one is very well though out and executed!<br/>TC</td>', 'Because this is a tall shot (and I didn''t expand my browser) I had to scroll up and down a little to get all the shot.  Doing this, I accidently noticed that if you crop just under the 4 lights at the top, you end up with a MUCH more potent shot!  This does cut off the taller ''ghosts'' head, but it still has more ''pop''!   I''m not a big fan of the ''ghost'' images but this one is very well though out and executed!TC', '2004-03-05 00:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(610240, 62595, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome job of capturing the smoke!  Your matchstick seems a little over sharpened or overexposed.  Nice shot overall!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome job of capturing the smoke!  Your matchstick seems a little over sharpened or overexposed.  Nice shot overall!TC', '2004-03-05 00:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(610241, 62728, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot.  However, I do not see any fire or anything that I would take to represent fire here.  Therefore, under the guidelines of the rules I can not give you a very high score!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very cool shot.  However, I do not see any fire or anything that I would take to represent fire here.  Therefore, under the guidelines of the rules I can not give you a very high score!TC', '2004-03-05 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
