(610389, 62823, 11078, '<td valign="top">very clever  nice detail</td>', 'very clever  nice detail', '2004-03-05 03:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(610390, 62559, 11078, '<td valign="top">nice detail and focus is sharp 7</td>', 'nice detail and focus is sharp 7', '2004-03-05 03:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(610391, 62729, 11078, '<td valign="top">very nice photo and model</td>', 'very nice photo and model', '2004-03-05 03:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(610408, 62592, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-03-05 04:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(610418, 62475, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very bold silhouette. Works very well with the frame. The sky color really help to push the colors of the fire forward and makes it pop out of the shot. Abstract, form, colors , little bit of everything. "10"</td>', 'Very bold silhouette. Works very well with the frame. The sky color really help to push the colors of the fire forward and makes it pop out of the shot. Abstract, form, colors , little bit of everything. "10"', '2004-03-05 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(610419, 62650, 10084, '<td valign="top">The burning mask gives a haunting feeling. Love the beautiful curves in the flames. Like the way the eyes are dark and your own eyes seem to focus on them. "9" upgrade to "10"</td>', 'The burning mask gives a haunting feeling. Love the beautiful curves in the flames. Like the way the eyes are dark and your own eyes seem to focus on them. "9" upgrade to "10"', '2004-03-05 04:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610420, 62411, 10084, '<td valign="top">Simple composition is very interesting. Love the bold blackness of the tree. The angle you chose makes it very dynamic. Love the halo of sunlight on the bottom of the tree. Gives a feeling of fire. The bright vibrant hues of sunlight really makes this shot dramatic. "10"</td>', 'Simple composition is very interesting. Love the bold blackness of the tree. The angle you chose makes it very dynamic. Love the halo of sunlight on the bottom of the tree. Gives a feeling of fire. The bright vibrant hues of sunlight really makes this shot dramatic. "10"', '2004-03-05 04:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(610422, 62244, 10084, '<td valign="top">The blue flames makes this shot very interesting. Love how the flame gives you a great sense of the contour of the mug. Simple composition simply amazing. "9" upgrade to "10"</td>', 'The blue flames makes this shot very interesting. Love how the flame gives you a great sense of the contour of the mug. Simple composition simply amazing. "9" upgrade to "10"', '2004-03-05 04:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(610423, 62359, 10084, '<td valign="top">Having both eyes in the composition takes away from the composition. The fire is quite small to make out.  Focusing on 1 eye would give the viewer a closer look at the eye and thus the flame. Currently the slanted composition is fairly interesting and is still good. The b&amp;w combined with the touch of color for the fire is good. "8"</td>', 'Having both eyes in the composition takes away from the composition. The fire is quite small to make out.  Focusing on 1 eye would give the viewer a closer look at the eye and thus the flame. Currently the slanted composition is fairly interesting and is still good. The b&w combined with the touch of color for the fire is good. "8"', '2004-03-05 04:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(610424, 62214, 10084, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop of the face would work a lot better. The area of the shoulder with the red is what you focus on because of the color. Cropping this out would bring the focus back to the glasses. Otherwise good concept. Fire looks good on the lens and the highlights on the rim is interesting.</td>', 'I think a closer crop of the face would work a lot better. The area of the shoulder with the red is what you focus on because of the color. Cropping this out would bring the focus back to the glasses. Otherwise good concept. Fire looks good on the lens and the highlights on the rim is interesting.', '2004-03-05 04:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(610425, 62200, 10084, '<td valign="top">Absolute beautiful capture of the vibrant hues in the flames. The flames really gives you a sense of the contour of the glass. Love the great highlights on the rim of the glass and the base. The spotlight on the bottom adds an excellent touch to the composition. "10"</td>', 'Absolute beautiful capture of the vibrant hues in the flames. The flames really gives you a sense of the contour of the glass. Love the great highlights on the rim of the glass and the base. The spotlight on the bottom adds an excellent touch to the composition. "10"', '2004-03-05 04:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(610426, 62804, 10084, '<td valign="top">I think a vertical crop may work better with this subject. Currently seems like too much negative space. Really like seeing  the wood grain of the table. "9"</td>', 'I think a vertical crop may work better with this subject. Currently seems like too much negative space. Really like seeing  the wood grain of the table. "9"', '2004-03-05 04:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(610429, 62724, 16075, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed</td>', 'Nicely composed', '2004-03-05 04:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(610431, 62522, 16075, '<td valign="top">Arm that is supposed to be in the fire is very phony looking.</td>', 'Arm that is supposed to be in the fire is very phony looking.', '2004-03-05 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610432, 62681, 10084, '<td valign="top">The shape of the heart formed with fire really makes for an interesting composition. The black background really helps to make the great hues in the flames to pop out of the shot. Simple design. I love it. "10"</td>', 'The shape of the heart formed with fire really makes for an interesting composition. The black background really helps to make the great hues in the flames to pop out of the shot. Simple design. I love it. "10"', '2004-03-05 05:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(610433, 62729, 16075, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Interesting composition.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Interesting composition.', '2004-03-05 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(610434, 62339, 16075, '<td valign="top">Too much uninteresting dead space on the right hand side of the picture.</td>', 'Too much uninteresting dead space on the right hand side of the picture.', '2004-03-05 05:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(610435, 62300, 16075, '<td valign="top">Not a good quality capture...too blurry.</td>', 'Not a good quality capture...too blurry.', '2004-03-05 05:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(610436, 62595, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how this is different then most of the flame shots. This one includes the beauty of the smoke. The great shapes and forms that it make while it floats up. "10"</td>', 'I like how this is different then most of the flame shots. This one includes the beauty of the smoke. The great shapes and forms that it make while it floats up. "10"', '2004-03-05 05:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(610437, 62359, 16075, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think you needed a larger flame to reflect in the eyes to really be able to pull this one off.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think you needed a larger flame to reflect in the eyes to really be able to pull this one off.', '2004-03-05 05:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(610438, 62324, 16075, '<td valign="top">Indeed these petals do resemble flames but you may be stretching the concept of the challenge a bit.</td>', 'Indeed these petals do resemble flames but you may be stretching the concept of the challenge a bit.', '2004-03-05 05:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(610439, 62721, 16004, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  You are committed!  You torched your barn for the challenge!  Very exciting and dramatic shot.  10!</td>', 'Whoa!  You are committed!  You torched your barn for the challenge!  Very exciting and dramatic shot.  10!', '2004-03-05 05:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
