(610574, 62759, 15920, '<td valign="top">I decided I liked this more the second time I looked, so I need to adjust the score a little.  The flame is overexposed, but the detail on the lamp and the color there makes up for a relatively small exposure error.  Sorry for the first score.</td>', 'I decided I liked this more the second time I looked, so I need to adjust the score a little.  The flame is overexposed, but the detail on the lamp and the color there makes up for a relatively small exposure error.  Sorry for the first score.', '2004-03-05 07:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
