(610666, 62398, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea, nice shot.', '2004-03-05 09:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(610768, 62804, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of the shot and the shadow it creates. The texture of the wood table is good also. What I dont like is the flame itself - it''s rather large and mostly just a big white blob with no detail or shifts of color. The idea is fine, the set up is fine, the flame isnt fine.</td>', 'I like the lighting of the shot and the shadow it creates. The texture of the wood table is good also. What I dont like is the flame itself - it''s rather large and mostly just a big white blob with no detail or shifts of color. The idea is fine, the set up is fine, the flame isnt fine.', '2004-03-05 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(610783, 62240, 6008, '<td valign="top">The concept is good and I really hope that was an old printer you torched! I''m not usually one to complain about borders but the thick orange part of the border tries to steal a lot of eye time from the actual picture - it may be because the image space is quite small.</td>', 'The concept is good and I really hope that was an old printer you torched! I''m not usually one to complain about borders but the thick orange part of the border tries to steal a lot of eye time from the actual picture - it may be because the image space is quite small.', '2004-03-05 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(610788, 62698, 6008, '<td valign="top">The match seems out of focus and the flame is a little too bright, although it does have some color at the bottom of it. Good diagonal on the match.</td>', 'The match seems out of focus and the flame is a little too bright, although it does have some color at the bottom of it. Good diagonal on the match.', '2004-03-05 12:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(610795, 62783, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, certainly has visual impact.</td>', 'Interesting idea, certainly has visual impact.', '2004-03-05 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(610801, 62287, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the orange smoke plume, very ethereal. The light streaks at the bottom are interesting too. Nicely captured.</td>', 'I like the orange smoke plume, very ethereal. The light streaks at the bottom are interesting too. Nicely captured.', '2004-03-05 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(610807, 61913, 6008, '<td valign="top">The rocks are good, adds texture and interest. The flames are not bad and show some color shift. Only nitpick is the large dark area at the bottom - I would have prefered more of the rocks or more flame there as it seems to be where my eyes fall.</td>', 'The rocks are good, adds texture and interest. The flames are not bad and show some color shift. Only nitpick is the large dark area at the bottom - I would have prefered more of the rocks or more flame there as it seems to be where my eyes fall.', '2004-03-05 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(610817, 62810, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this. Has a great mood with the coloration of the skates, good use of negative space, and good composition. The ''sparks'' or fire adds interest and curiosity. Nicely captured!</td>', 'I like this. Has a great mood with the coloration of the skates, good use of negative space, and good composition. The ''sparks'' or fire adds interest and curiosity. Nicely captured!', '2004-03-05 12:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(610824, 62711, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems to be too even with everything at the same illumination. The background seems to be lit too much and probably would have been better with it more in the shadow so the fire could stand out more and be more dramatic. The right hand seems to be ''out of shot'' and so could potentially be doing something to create the flames, but I have to admit that it looks a little photoshopped. The welding mask is a neat touch.</td>', 'The lighting seems to be too even with everything at the same illumination. The background seems to be lit too much and probably would have been better with it more in the shadow so the fire could stand out more and be more dramatic. The right hand seems to be ''out of shot'' and so could potentially be doing something to create the flames, but I have to admit that it looks a little photoshopped. The welding mask is a neat touch.', '2004-03-05 12:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610831, 62548, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, but I cant decide whether I like the burner being ''dirty'' or not - it does add color and some texture. I think the abstractness of it may have been better without the kettle too. As for meeting the challenge - well it''s not fire but is heat so I''ll give it an out of the box vote.</td>', 'The composition is good, but I cant decide whether I like the burner being ''dirty'' or not - it does add color and some texture. I think the abstractness of it may have been better without the kettle too. As for meeting the challenge - well it''s not fire but is heat so I''ll give it an out of the box vote.', '2004-03-05 12:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(610833, 62221, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks somewhat interesting, and even appears like you had a nice blue flame originally too. I''m not against digital art, but I think in a photography contest there should be more of a photograph. Sorry.</td>', 'Looks somewhat interesting, and even appears like you had a nice blue flame originally too. I''m not against digital art, but I think in a photography contest there should be more of a photograph. Sorry.', '2004-03-05 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(610838, 62559, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the burnt paper and I can see you have a slight edge glow too. Composition is good, nice color gradient to the flame. The repeated word paper isnt new but it works here, and it''s almost like an anti-repeated word message. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the texture of the burnt paper and I can see you have a slight edge glow too. Composition is good, nice color gradient to the flame. The repeated word paper isnt new but it works here, and it''s almost like an anti-repeated word message. Nicely done.', '2004-03-05 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(610840, 62589, 6008, '<td valign="top">Simple wth a nice color gradient, appealing shapes and curves, and it does look like a fire demon.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'Simple wth a nice color gradient, appealing shapes and curves, and it does look like a fire demon.  Nicely captured.', '2004-03-05 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610842, 62725, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition and capture of the flame.  Ilike the play of lines vs the round disk and rounded flames.  Hope your equiptment is still in running order?</td>', 'good composition and capture of the flame.  Ilike the play of lines vs the round disk and rounded flames.  Hope your equiptment is still in running order?', '2004-03-05 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610844, 62666, 2752, '<td valign="top">great capture of working men and the flames.  the fire looks very hot and the gasses  dangerous.</td>', 'great capture of working men and the flames.  the fire looks very hot and the gasses  dangerous.', '2004-03-05 12:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(610847, 62347, 2752, '<td valign="top">excellent capture of the heat and flames of a log fire.</td>', 'excellent capture of the heat and flames of a log fire.', '2004-03-05 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(610881, 62339, 7291, '<td valign="top">The top of the flame looks a bit over processed.  Nice subject matter however.</td>', 'The top of the flame looks a bit over processed.  Nice subject matter however.', '2004-03-05 13:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(610882, 62595, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I''ve already left a comment or not, but you just know a winner when you see one and this one is a winner.  Fanstastic picture.  I''d love to see how you accomplished this.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I''ve already left a comment or not, but you just know a winner when you see one and this one is a winner.  Fanstastic picture.  I''d love to see how you accomplished this.', '2004-03-05 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
