(610892, 62614, 7291, '<td valign="top">Although this is technically fire, I think it misses the point.  That being said this is a great picture.  I wonder what this looks like in it''s original version.</td>', 'Although this is technically fire, I think it misses the point.  That being said this is a great picture.  I wonder what this looks like in it''s original version.', '2004-03-05 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
