(610901, 62819, 7291, '<td valign="top">Well that certainly worked out for you didn''t it?  I like the nice soft flames.</td>', 'Well that certainly worked out for you didn''t it?  I like the nice soft flames.', '2004-03-05 13:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
