(611093, 62666, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good photojournalistic work. I like your as it is composition, no posing, no setup (I hope ;)  ).</td>', 'Good photojournalistic work. I like your as it is composition, no posing, no setup (I hope ;)  ).', '2004-03-05 17:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(611095, 62314, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like this approach to this challenge. This photo creates a classic mood, subtle soft toning, the feather finishes it off. Good work.</td>', 'I like this approach to this challenge. This photo creates a classic mood, subtle soft toning, the feather finishes it off. Good work.', '2004-03-05 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(611099, 62371, 3032, '<td valign="top">I had the idea to do something with a sparkplug as well. But they are quite boring, even when they are sparking. This is great though, good setup, well executed. I wonder how it was done (floating sparkplug with sparks in bg). The only flaw is that a sparkplug cannot spark when there is no connector on top. :)</td>', 'I had the idea to do something with a sparkplug as well. But they are quite boring, even when they are sparking. This is great though, good setup, well executed. I wonder how it was done (floating sparkplug with sparks in bg). The only flaw is that a sparkplug cannot spark when there is no connector on top. :)', '2004-03-05 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(611102, 62678, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern to the left. Good idea and good capture of the tones of the flames.</td>', 'Interesting pattern to the left. Good idea and good capture of the tones of the flames.', '2004-03-05 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(611103, 62749, 3032, '<td valign="top">There is nothing like the grainfields of Southern Sweden. Love that area.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'There is nothing like the grainfields of Southern Sweden. Love that area.Well done.', '2004-03-05 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(611198, 62721, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see a wider view of this fire.</td>', 'I''d have liked to see a wider view of this fire.', '2004-03-05 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(611209, 62759, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Good colour and well-composed. I like shallow dof but here I would have preferred to see the flame sharper. 8</td>', 'Nice image. Good colour and well-composed. I like shallow dof but here I would have preferred to see the flame sharper. 8', '2004-03-05 19:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(611211, 62673, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice image but it''s not really fire. 6</td>', 'Nice image but it''s not really fire. 6', '2004-03-05 19:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611213, 62289, 12160, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo. The colours are good and I can tell you put a lot of effort in creating this. The white of the flame is overexposed, perhaps a faster shutter speed would reduce the light and get a better focus on the yellow and blue flames. 6</td>', 'Not a bad photo. The colours are good and I can tell you put a lot of effort in creating this. The white of the flame is overexposed, perhaps a faster shutter speed would reduce the light and get a better focus on the yellow and blue flames. 6', '2004-03-05 19:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(611217, 62214, 12160, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I just wished it was a closer shot perhaps not showing the shoulder at all.</td>', 'Neat idea. I just wished it was a closer shot perhaps not showing the shoulder at all.', '2004-03-05 19:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(611220, 62434, 12160, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Great colours and pin sharp focus. My top 5 pick -10.</td>', 'Awesome shot. Great colours and pin sharp focus. My top 5 pick -10.', '2004-03-05 19:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(611225, 62122, 12160, '<td valign="top">love the abstract streaks of light. beautiful. Top ten finish. good luck!</td>', 'love the abstract streaks of light. beautiful. Top ten finish. good luck!', '2004-03-05 19:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(611226, 62392, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the saturation but it''s a little noisy. Great composition. 7</td>', 'Love the saturation but it''s a little noisy. Great composition. 7', '2004-03-05 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(611230, 62569, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sharp focus. What was burning?</td>', 'Nice composition and sharp focus. What was burning?', '2004-03-05 19:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611269, 62371, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is definitely my favourite so far.</td>', 'This is definitely my favourite so far.', '2004-03-05 20:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(611273, 62570, 2158, '<td valign="top">Despite the black &amp; white, my attention is still more drawn to the fireman top right than to the fire itself.  Overall I like it a lot.</td>', 'Despite the black & white, my attention is still more drawn to the fireman top right than to the fire itself.  Overall I like it a lot.', '2004-03-05 20:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(611275, 62759, 2717, '<td valign="top">This brought back memories of rabbit hunting with a carbite light.  Also tell my age....  oh yea cool picture.. 9</td>', 'This brought back memories of rabbit hunting with a carbite light.  Also tell my age....  oh yea cool picture.. 9', '2004-03-05 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(611293, 62595, 16912, '<td valign="top">My personal thought is a ribbon is on its way! <br/>Talk about cliches, but this is probably the best match shot I have seen. Focus is spot on and the straight lines of the smoke turn what might have been a good shot into a winner, the title also leads me to think of the ''other'' person (so simple but yet conveys so much)<br/> <br/>Trying to find a negative I''d say the match may be a little overexposed</td>', 'My personal thought is a ribbon is on its way! Talk about cliches, but this is probably the best match shot I have seen. Focus is spot on and the straight lines of the smoke turn what might have been a good shot into a winner, the title also leads me to think of the ''other'' person (so simple but yet conveys so much) Trying to find a negative I''d say the match may be a little overexposed', '2004-03-05 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(611300, 62649, 16912, '<td valign="top">Well composed picture and the berries are named ''fire'' but I really don''t think it meets the challenge (maybe I''m to litteral in my thinking)</td>', 'Well composed picture and the berries are named ''fire'' but I really don''t think it meets the challenge (maybe I''m to litteral in my thinking)', '2004-03-05 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(611303, 62324, 16912, '<td valign="top">Not the first time I''ve said this, a great picture but imho does not fit the true remit of the challenge.</td>', 'Not the first time I''ve said this, a great picture but imho does not fit the true remit of the challenge.', '2004-03-05 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(611308, 62119, 16912, '<td valign="top">I think the moon is a little blured and thought the sun was the fire in the sky? I do like the composition of the picture though, gives a good feeling of space. As for fire? not sure it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I think the moon is a little blured and thought the sun was the fire in the sky? I do like the composition of the picture though, gives a good feeling of space. As for fire? not sure it meets the challenge.', '2004-03-05 21:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611316, 62780, 16912, '<td valign="top">I do like this picture but think there is a little too much ''dirt'' around the left edge of the glass and noise? at the bottom. I understand the ''fire'' element of the sauce but don''t really think it fits the challenge (maybe I''ve become a dpc purist?)</td>', 'I do like this picture but think there is a little too much ''dirt'' around the left edge of the glass and noise? at the bottom. I understand the ''fire'' element of the sauce but don''t really think it fits the challenge (maybe I''ve become a dpc purist?)', '2004-03-05 21:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611318, 62589, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice work... I love the form that these flames are taking in this image :)</td>', 'Very nice work... I love the form that these flames are taking in this image :)', '2004-03-05 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(611320, 62823, 8624, '<td valign="top">I was going to vote this down, but waited and saw that it was validated, so I want to give you the benefit of the doubt and rate this highly. It is a well composed image and certainly has visual appeal. I look forward to reading the details of how you created it.</td>', 'I was going to vote this down, but waited and saw that it was validated, so I want to give you the benefit of the doubt and rate this highly. It is a well composed image and certainly has visual appeal. I look forward to reading the details of how you created it.', '2004-03-05 21:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(611321, 62724, 16912, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea but feel the shot is a little cluttetred and the flame would have looked better if it was shot against the back led of the fondue kit.</td>', 'I do like the idea but feel the shot is a little cluttetred and the flame would have looked better if it was shot against the back led of the fondue kit.', '2004-03-05 21:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(611323, 62804, 8624, '<td valign="top">good idea but the exposure suffers from too little dynamic range. the flame is sorta gray. the lines in the wood in the center of the frame are also a distraction.</td>', 'good idea but the exposure suffers from too little dynamic range. the flame is sorta gray. the lines in the wood in the center of the frame are also a distraction.', '2004-03-05 21:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(611326, 62646, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot. the flame is nicely shaped and the angles you present with the lighter are visually appealing. I think you hurt a strong image, however, by oversaturating it. The flame looks artificial now.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot. the flame is nicely shaped and the angles you present with the lighter are visually appealing. I think you hurt a strong image, however, by oversaturating it. The flame looks artificial now.', '2004-03-05 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611327, 62583, 8624, '<td valign="top">good image, good idea. I don''t like the frame, I think it distracts, but I don''t vote on frames. nice job.</td>', 'good image, good idea. I don''t like the frame, I think it distracts, but I don''t vote on frames. nice job.', '2004-03-05 21:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611331, 62486, 16912, '<td valign="top">I liked the composition of this shot and am suprised there were not more sun images. I had to download the picture to see the foreground (I need to sort out my monitor). the red sky at the top seems a too manipulated, maybe its my monitor again?</td>', 'I liked the composition of this shot and am suprised there were not more sun images. I had to download the picture to see the foreground (I need to sort out my monitor). the red sky at the top seems a too manipulated, maybe its my monitor again?', '2004-03-05 21:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(611337, 62548, 16912, '<td valign="top">Your cooker looks a little like mine, needs cleaning! <br/>The background has a refelction that distracts me from the subject. The point of focus appears to be the front of the ring and I''d have liked to have seen it on the labe. A well cropped picture and I  like the idea of fire, what is the bottle?</td>', 'Your cooker looks a little like mine, needs cleaning! The background has a refelction that distracts me from the subject. The point of focus appears to be the front of the ring and I''d have liked to have seen it on the labe. A well cropped picture and I  like the idea of fire, what is the bottle?', '2004-03-05 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(611350, 62122, 16912, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge? of course, real fireflies?<br/> I really like the composition of the shot, especially the softness of the flame coupled with the crispness of the ''fire flies''</td>', 'Meets the challenge? of course, real fireflies? I really like the composition of the shot, especially the softness of the flame coupled with the crispness of the ''fire flies''', '2004-03-05 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(611354, 62650, 16912, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and its sort of scary if your depicting the devil? I like the flame around the mouth and the black eyes.</td>', 'Love the shot and its sort of scary if your depicting the devil? I like the flame around the mouth and the black eyes.', '2004-03-05 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611358, 62681, 16912, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, I like what you have done, the softness of the flames add to the scene.</td>', 'Clever shot, I like what you have done, the softness of the flames add to the scene.', '2004-03-05 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(611364, 62729, 16912, '<td valign="top">Meets the fire challenge? obviously and goes on to add feelings.<br/>The shot seems to depict a lost lover? it certainly made me reminisce.</td>', 'Meets the fire challenge? obviously and goes on to add feelings.The shot seems to depict a lost lover? it certainly made me reminisce.', '2004-03-05 22:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(611370, 62533, 16912, '<td valign="top">If only I could do that! Love the picture and would have preferred it if the title was something like ''Yeah!'' or ''no more''</td>', 'If only I could do that! Love the picture and would have preferred it if the title was something like ''Yeah!'' or ''no more''', '2004-03-05 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(611383, 62423, 16912, '<td valign="top">If this wasn''t a fire challenge I''d probably not be able to say what this is! but as I know its ''fire'' it makes what may be a confusing shot into a very clever one. Even as a confusing shot its great if you know what I mean?<br/></td>', 'If this wasn''t a fire challenge I''d probably not be able to say what this is! but as I know its ''fire'' it makes what may be a confusing shot into a very clever one. Even as a confusing shot its great if you know what I mean?', '2004-03-05 22:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
