(612245, 62824, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very funny take on the challenge.  Are these cayenne?  Love the hot peppers.<br/>Good job of framing against the dark background!  Nice focus.  Your lighing could be a little more interesting to give more depth to the plant...<br/>Your border is not even all around.  When increasing your canvas size you need to make sure you are doing it in even numbers of pixels.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very funny take on the challenge.  Are these cayenne?  Love the hot peppers.Good job of framing against the dark background!  Nice focus.  Your lighing could be a little more interesting to give more depth to the plant...Your border is not even all around.  When increasing your canvas size you need to make sure you are doing it in even numbers of pixels.TC', '2004-03-06 22:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
