(612308, 62221, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice effect; I like it. Except for the large gray area.</td>', 'Nice effect; I like it. Except for the large gray area.', '2004-03-07 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(612309, 62781, 10402, '<td valign="top">It''s impossible to capture a flickering flame in a still photo, but this image comes close. It nicely captures the essence of fire.</td>', 'It''s impossible to capture a flickering flame in a still photo, but this image comes close. It nicely captures the essence of fire.', '2004-03-07 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612310, 62423, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice graceful shape and smooth texture. Although it''s obviously fire, I don''t really get the feeling of flame. But it nevertheless a beautiful image.</td>', 'Nice graceful shape and smooth texture. Although it''s obviously fire, I don''t really get the feeling of flame. But it nevertheless a beautiful image.', '2004-03-07 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(612313, 62002, 10402, '<td valign="top">I lke the idea here, but it doesn''t really work. The hearth separates the photo into two separate images and nothing really ties them together. The light from the right rear overpowers the light from the fire for shadow direction, which further separates the elements. An additional light on the left would lighten the shadow, and lowering the camera, maybe even putting it on the floor, might help tie the elements together better.</td>', 'I lke the idea here, but it doesn''t really work. The hearth separates the photo into two separate images and nothing really ties them together. The light from the right rear overpowers the light from the fire for shadow direction, which further separates the elements. An additional light on the left would lighten the shadow, and lowering the camera, maybe even putting it on the floor, might help tie the elements together better.', '2004-03-07 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(612314, 62678, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice shape and interesting texture.</td>', 'Nice shape and interesting texture.', '2004-03-07 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(612316, 62565, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, although I think a vertical format would better suit the subject.</td>', 'Nicely done, although I think a vertical format would better suit the subject.', '2004-03-07 00:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612321, 62650, 18153, '<td valign="top">great and original</td>', 'great and original', '2004-03-07 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(612394, 62434, 10084, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful colors. The contrasting background really helps to bring out the wonderful colors of the lure and the flame.  The flames were capture with a very curvy and beautiful shape. "10"</td>', 'Such beautiful colors. The contrasting background really helps to bring out the wonderful colors of the lure and the flame.  The flames were capture with a very curvy and beautiful shape. "10"', '2004-03-07 02:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(612463, 62811, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very moody composition. Really like the great shadow captured of the lamp on the wall. I think the muted colors may turn people off to the shot. A little experimenting with monotone would give more impact to the shot. "8"</td>', 'Very moody composition. Really like the great shadow captured of the lamp on the wall. I think the muted colors may turn people off to the shot. A little experimenting with monotone would give more impact to the shot. "8"', '2004-03-07 03:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(612466, 62770, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composiiton. The circular shape of the cd gives a good spot for your eyes to focus on. The blue of the flame looks like you can feel the movement, it looks very fluid. "8"</td>', 'Interesting composiiton. The circular shape of the cd gives a good spot for your eyes to focus on. The blue of the flame looks like you can feel the movement, it looks very fluid. "8"', '2004-03-07 03:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612467, 62221, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The angle that you shot the subject at makes it quite dynamic and abstract. The swirling center of the burner is a great focal point for your eyes. I like the golden colors that you were able to create. "8"</td>', 'Interesting composition. The angle that you shot the subject at makes it quite dynamic and abstract. The swirling center of the burner is a great focal point for your eyes. I like the golden colors that you were able to create. "8"', '2004-03-07 03:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(612469, 62339, 10084, '<td valign="top">A vertical compositioning of the frame would help to make this shot more interesting. The negative space on the right makes your eyes wander away from the main subject. Interesting details of the dragon handle on the lamp.</td>', 'A vertical compositioning of the frame would help to make this shot more interesting. The negative space on the right makes your eyes wander away from the main subject. Interesting details of the dragon handle on the lamp.', '2004-03-07 03:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(612470, 62557, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I like the idea. Unfortunately the lights in the background distracts from the main subjects , the ghost. Your eyes will looks at the main fire and wander away toward the lights on the top. I would try reshooting because this is an excellent idea.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I like the idea. Unfortunately the lights in the background distracts from the main subjects , the ghost. Your eyes will looks at the main fire and wander away toward the lights on the top. I would try reshooting because this is an excellent idea.', '2004-03-07 03:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(612473, 62570, 10084, '<td valign="top">The desaturation of the colors except the fire makes your eyes focus on the fire.  The normally red or yellow color of the truck is white, which is interesting. It actually brings your eyes toward the side of the truck and follows the water toward the fire.  This gives you eyes some great focus points. From "9" to a "10"</td>', 'The desaturation of the colors except the fire makes your eyes focus on the fire.  The normally red or yellow color of the truck is white, which is interesting. It actually brings your eyes toward the side of the truck and follows the water toward the fire.  This gives you eyes some great focus points. From "9" to a "10"', '2004-03-07 03:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(612478, 62536, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract peak at the flames/heat. The eyes give an interesting focal point. Excellent colors with the yellow/orange/red. The dark foreground workds well with the burning subject. Nice and simple composition."9"</td>', 'Interesting abstract peak at the flames/heat. The eyes give an interesting focal point. Excellent colors with the yellow/orange/red. The dark foreground workds well with the burning subject. Nice and simple composition."9"', '2004-03-07 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(612481, 62398, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting kind of makes this a bit dramatic with the sparkplug being lit just a bit and still looking quite dark. The blue background works good to bring out the subject. The blue highlights adds a nice touch to the sparkplug. Diagonal placement of subject in the frame gives it a dynamic feeling . "8"</td>', 'Lighting kind of makes this a bit dramatic with the sparkplug being lit just a bit and still looking quite dark. The blue background works good to bring out the subject. The blue highlights adds a nice touch to the sparkplug. Diagonal placement of subject in the frame gives it a dynamic feeling . "8"', '2004-03-07 04:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(612483, 62289, 10084, '<td valign="top">The compostion is quite interesting but the cropping gives a feeling of the subjects tipping over. Incredible colors in the flames really makes this dynamic shot abstract and quite nice to look at.</td>', 'The compostion is quite interesting but the cropping gives a feeling of the subjects tipping over. Incredible colors in the flames really makes this dynamic shot abstract and quite nice to look at.', '2004-03-07 04:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612485, 62651, 10084, '<td valign="top">The sparks flying from the flames gives the composition a dynamic feeling. Excellent colors of the gases from the flame. Beautiful hues.</td>', 'The sparks flying from the flames gives the composition a dynamic feeling. Excellent colors of the gases from the flame. Beautiful hues.', '2004-03-07 04:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612489, 62430, 10084, '<td valign="top">Angle of the placement of the subjects makes the composition dynamic and interesting. Love the little details in the wooden handle. The black background really makes the flame pop out. Nice and simple and well shot. "10"</td>', 'Angle of the placement of the subjects makes the composition dynamic and interesting. Love the little details in the wooden handle. The black background really makes the flame pop out. Nice and simple and well shot. "10"', '2004-03-07 04:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(612492, 62687, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The orange in the sunset/sunrise gives a really nice warm feeling. The streak of yellow breaks up the sky and makes the scene more interesting. The dark silhouette make the sky pop out even more. Nice simple.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The orange in the sunset/sunrise gives a really nice warm feeling. The streak of yellow breaks up the sky and makes the scene more interesting. The dark silhouette make the sky pop out even more. Nice simple.', '2004-03-07 04:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(612506, 62240, 15002, '<td valign="top">the background is a bit distracting</td>', 'the background is a bit distracting', '2004-03-07 06:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
