(612773, 62824, 17203, '<td valign="top">I think the dark might background on this one is hurting you- just zoom in close on one or two peppers and light ''er up! The contrasting red and green colors are nice, the off-center border is not.</td>', 'I think the dark might background on this one is hurting you- just zoom in close on one or two peppers and light ''er up! The contrasting red and green colors are nice, the off-center border is not.', '2004-03-07 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(612774, 62711, 17203, '<td valign="top">This could have been really cool if only you''d cropped just the hand and shot in brighter light to cut down on noise levels. I appreciate the obvious trouble you went to for the flames, though.</td>', 'This could have been really cool if only you''d cropped just the hand and shot in brighter light to cut down on noise levels. I appreciate the obvious trouble you went to for the flames, though.', '2004-03-07 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(612776, 62644, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like the transparency of the flames and thermal distortions in the background. I think it could have been even better with a vertical crop of the left side.</td>', 'Very cool. I like the transparency of the flames and thermal distortions in the background. I think it could have been even better with a vertical crop of the left side.', '2004-03-07 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(612777, 62698, 17203, '<td valign="top">OK- foreground match and background lighter. The depth of field hurts you here- the flame is in focus but the match isn''t, so obviously they''re on different planes. Shoot this in brighter light... the flame won''t be as blown out and you''ll be able to increase depth of field.</td>', 'OK- foreground match and background lighter. The depth of field hurts you here- the flame is in focus but the match isn''t, so obviously they''re on different planes. Shoot this in brighter light... the flame won''t be as blown out and you''ll be able to increase depth of field.', '2004-03-07 12:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(612778, 62783, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but wouldn''t the flames be trailing an [upward] moving ball? Just turn the ball upside down before shooting and rotate the image 180 degrees to get the effect. A low-speed fan on the flames would really give the impression of a meteor.</td>', 'Good idea, but wouldn''t the flames be trailing an [upward] moving ball? Just turn the ball upside down before shooting and rotate the image 180 degrees to get the effect. A low-speed fan on the flames would really give the impression of a meteor.', '2004-03-07 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612780, 62646, 17203, '<td valign="top">Not exactly original. Maybe if you dropped some powder on the flame to get unusual colors or a few sparks? A more interesting background could help provide a context, too... maybe a moody scene with wine glasses and about to light a candle?</td>', 'Not exactly original. Maybe if you dropped some powder on the flame to get unusual colors or a few sparks? A more interesting background could help provide a context, too... maybe a moody scene with wine glasses and about to light a candle?', '2004-03-07 12:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(612782, 62613, 17203, '<td valign="top">So where was this statue in the Silence challenge? Nice fire, odd combination. The "God of Really Quiet Fire"?</td>', 'So where was this statue in the Silence challenge? Nice fire, odd combination. The "God of Really Quiet Fire"?', '2004-03-07 12:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612787, 62614, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool color, but it could hurt you in voting. Without a bright red sunset, it doesn''t really look like fire, so you have to think about the context. I found the composition more compelling when I cropped in much closer so you only see the more interesting parts of the scene.</td>', 'Cool color, but it could hurt you in voting. Without a bright red sunset, it doesn''t really look like fire, so you have to think about the context. I found the composition more compelling when I cropped in much closer so you only see the more interesting parts of the scene.', '2004-03-07 12:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(612788, 62729, 17203, '<td valign="top">Didn''t the rules specifically discourage arson? LOL Nicely lit.</td>', 'Didn''t the rules specifically discourage arson? LOL Nicely lit.', '2004-03-07 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612795, 62080, 17203, '<td valign="top">FOCUS! If I didn''t read the title, I wouldn''t have a clue what this is. Set a manual focus, then shine a bright light on the area and hold down the shutter halfway to set the exposure, then turn off the light, light the match and snap the shutter. It''s tricky, but do-able.</td>', 'FOCUS! If I didn''t read the title, I wouldn''t have a clue what this is. Set a manual focus, then shine a bright light on the area and hold down the shutter halfway to set the exposure, then turn off the light, light the match and snap the shutter. It''s tricky, but do-able.', '2004-03-07 12:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(612799, 62650, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept. Great job with the flames. A little noisy and dark on the top, but one of the strongest entries.</td>', 'Very interesting concept. Great job with the flames. A little noisy and dark on the top, but one of the strongest entries.', '2004-03-07 12:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(612803, 62725, 17203, '<td valign="top">I hope no equipment was harmed in this stunt, and glad you found a better use for the Windows installer disc! If you had shined a light on the scene, the flame wouldn''t have been as blown out.</td>', 'I hope no equipment was harmed in this stunt, and glad you found a better use for the Windows installer disc! If you had shined a light on the scene, the flame wouldn''t have been as blown out.', '2004-03-07 12:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(612808, 62728, 17203, '<td valign="top">Is this runoff from a fire hose? Now if the water had been on fire...</td>', 'Is this runoff from a fire hose? Now if the water had been on fire...', '2004-03-07 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(612813, 62700, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, but lack of detail in the flame hurts. A little more light or negative exposure compensation could have solved it.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, but lack of detail in the flame hurts. A little more light or negative exposure compensation could have solved it.', '2004-03-07 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612819, 62823, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool... a Palm Pilot-Light. Top hand is out of focus, though.</td>', 'Cool... a Palm Pilot-Light. Top hand is out of focus, though.', '2004-03-07 12:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(612823, 62522, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. "Can you hear me NAAAAAAAH!" LOL The back arm doesn''t look believable, though- too thin and bent just above the wrist.</td>', 'Cute idea. "Can you hear me NAAAAAAAH!" LOL The back arm doesn''t look believable, though- too thin and bent just above the wrist.', '2004-03-07 12:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(612828, 62649, 17203, '<td valign="top">Too much of a stretch for me. Fire is a difficult subject to shoot (hence the challenge) and you''ve avoided it completely. Still, you might have fared better if these were all in fcus.</td>', 'Too much of a stretch for me. Fire is a difficult subject to shoot (hence the challenge) and you''ve avoided it completely. Still, you might have fared better if these were all in fcus.', '2004-03-07 12:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(612833, 62721, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I guess you didn''t get too many takes! Very well done (literally), unlees you were caught with a can of gasoline in your car...</td>', 'Yikes! I guess you didn''t get too many takes! Very well done (literally), unlees you were caught with a can of gasoline in your car...', '2004-03-07 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(612836, 62303, 17203, '<td valign="top">Love the color. One of the top entries this week. A little oversharpened, though- the red flame is banding.</td>', 'Love the color. One of the top entries this week. A little oversharpened, though- the red flame is banding.', '2004-03-07 12:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612838, 62324, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily, I appreciate a looser interpretation of the challenge. In this case, though, fire is such a difficult subject to shoot that handling actual flame with your camera IS pretty much a requirement to me.</td>', 'Ordinarily, I appreciate a looser interpretation of the challenge. In this case, though, fire is such a difficult subject to shoot that handling actual flame with your camera IS pretty much a requirement to me.', '2004-03-07 13:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612843, 62673, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily, I appreciate a looser interpretation of the challenge. In this case, though, fire is such a difficult subject to shoot that handling actual flame with your camera IS pretty much a requirement to me. "A" for effort, 3 for challenge eligibility.</td>', 'Ordinarily, I appreciate a looser interpretation of the challenge. In this case, though, fire is such a difficult subject to shoot that handling actual flame with your camera IS pretty much a requirement to me. "A" for effort, 3 for challenge eligibility.', '2004-03-07 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
