(613210, 62372, 9906, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look quite right to me.  The edges of the flames are too abrupt.  It also looks almost like the bottle and flame were cut out and pasted.  What are the artifacts in the lower right corner?  Overall, it looks like there has been too much processing...<br/>TC</td>', 'This doesn''t look quite right to me.  The edges of the flames are too abrupt.  It also looks almost like the bottle and flame were cut out and pasted.  What are the artifacts in the lower right corner?  Overall, it looks like there has been too much processing...TC', '2004-03-07 21:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(613211, 62548, 9763, '<td valign="top">Eeeek, clean the stove for a photo contest photo!  I know it''s hard to get off, but focus more on the coils then, get the grease out of the photo!</td>', 'Eeeek, clean the stove for a photo contest photo!  I know it''s hard to get off, but focus more on the coils then, get the grease out of the photo!', '2004-03-07 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(613213, 62214, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great idea, wish the clarity was better</td>', 'Great idea, wish the clarity was better', '2004-03-07 21:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(613214, 62698, 9763, '<td valign="top">Blurry is not good for a shot like this, in my opinion</td>', 'Blurry is not good for a shot like this, in my opinion', '2004-03-07 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(613215, 62548, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO for a shot like this to work, you need to have a clean stove top.  The rust and grease take away from the overall impact of the shot.<br/>TC<br/>PS:  Nice originality for the theme!</td>', 'IMHO for a shot like this to work, you need to have a clean stove top.  The rust and grease take away from the overall impact of the shot.TCPS:  Nice originality for the theme!', '2004-03-07 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(613216, 62780, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Never cared for these though.  Can''t get over the smell...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot.  Never cared for these though.  Can''t get over the smell...TC', '2004-03-07 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(613218, 62314, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, almost the last shot of the challenge for me to vote on and I have my favorite for the theme!  Love the tonality, the uncluttered yet full composition and the simplicity of the single light source.  My only complaint (and it''s a small one) is the light itself is a bit overexposed and causes some flare.<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, almost the last shot of the challenge for me to vote on and I have my favorite for the theme!  Love the tonality, the uncluttered yet full composition and the simplicity of the single light source.  My only complaint (and it''s a small one) is the light itself is a bit overexposed and causes some flare.TC', '2004-03-07 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(613220, 62759, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m begining to believe there was some kind of conspiracy here.  My favorite two shots of this challenge are the last two I voted on.  This shot is awesome!  Love the simple color scheme and your use of the shallower DOF.  You also made good use of a secondary light source (but IMHO it''s just a touch too highlited on the right) to help bring out the textures and lighten up the shot.  Your crop is dead on (would love to see the out of camera shot to compare)!<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m begining to believe there was some kind of conspiracy here.  My favorite two shots of this challenge are the last two I voted on.  This shot is awesome!  Love the simple color scheme and your use of the shallower DOF.  You also made good use of a secondary light source (but IMHO it''s just a touch too highlited on the right) to help bring out the textures and lighten up the shot.  Your crop is dead on (would love to see the out of camera shot to compare)!KudosTC', '2004-03-07 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(613221, 62823, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very interested to see how this was achieved.  Guaranteed top-5</td>', 'Very interested to see how this was achieved.  Guaranteed top-5', '2004-03-07 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(613222, 62583, 11738, '<td valign="top">funniest entry of the lot.  Not too crazy about the border</td>', 'funniest entry of the lot.  Not too crazy about the border', '2004-03-07 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(613223, 62244, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tone in this shot.  I''m not sure the shot is truly in focus, but it doesn''t seem to matter too much.  Can''t wait to see how this was done!  The only thing I don''t like is the blue part of the border.  It is too bright and wants to pull my eye away from the shot.  A darker blue (or simple black by itself) may have been better.  How many glasses did you break doing this?<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the blue tone in this shot.  I''m not sure the shot is truly in focus, but it doesn''t seem to matter too much.  Can''t wait to see how this was done!  The only thing I don''t like is the blue part of the border.  It is too bright and wants to pull my eye away from the shot.  A darker blue (or simple black by itself) may have been better.  How many glasses did you break doing this?TC', '2004-03-07 22:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(613228, 62749, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent product shot.  the label or whatever that is on the back side of the bottle seems to break the fluidity of color here a bit.  nice job with the lighting.</td>', 'excellent product shot.  the label or whatever that is on the back side of the bottle seems to break the fluidity of color here a bit.  nice job with the lighting.', '2004-03-07 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613232, 62392, 772, '<td valign="top">nice abstract and strong use of color... excellent work.</td>', 'nice abstract and strong use of color... excellent work.', '2004-03-07 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(613234, 62324, 772, '<td valign="top">nice interpretation... the color here seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'nice interpretation... the color here seems a bit harsh.', '2004-03-07 22:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(613235, 62681, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice... this is an excellent interpretation of this challenge :)</td>', 'very nice... this is an excellent interpretation of this challenge :)', '2004-03-07 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613242, 62359, 7339, '<td valign="top">Good idea but on my monitor I find it hard to make out the flames. If they were more pronounced I would have rated it higher.</td>', 'Good idea but on my monitor I find it hard to make out the flames. If they were more pronounced I would have rated it higher.', '2004-03-07 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(613243, 62570, 7339, '<td valign="top">Being a fireman myself I found it hard not to like this image. I like how you got rid of all color except the fire. Nice shot, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Being a fireman myself I found it hard not to like this image. I like how you got rid of all color except the fire. Nice shot, I gave it a 7.', '2004-03-07 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(613247, 62595, 7339, '<td valign="top">Nice photo very smooth smoke and flame. I really like how the match hasn''t finished lighting yet also.  I believe this will either take 1st place and if not its definatly in the top 3. Nice Job.  8</td>', 'Nice photo very smooth smoke and flame. I really like how the match hasn''t finished lighting yet also.  I believe this will either take 1st place and if not its definatly in the top 3. Nice Job.  8', '2004-03-07 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(613248, 62800, 10570, '<td valign="top">I love the blues in this.. icey blue and fire red..</td>', 'I love the blues in this.. icey blue and fire red..', '2004-03-07 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(613249, 62700, 7339, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really like gradation of the flame and how it blends nicely with the border you chose. Good job.</td>', 'Very cool. I really like gradation of the flame and how it blends nicely with the border you chose. Good job.', '2004-03-07 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(613253, 62728, 7339, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very beautiful image, nicely composed and tack sharp where it neads to be. Unfortunatly it dosent bring to mind fire. I realize it can be used to put out fire but I still dont see this photo showing or bringing to mind fire. Still very nice shot.</td>', 'I think this is a very beautiful image, nicely composed and tack sharp where it neads to be. Unfortunatly it dosent bring to mind fire. I realize it can be used to put out fire but I still dont see this photo showing or bringing to mind fire. Still very nice shot.', '2004-03-07 23:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(613254, 62725, 13390, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge!!! Extremely cerative and clever. I notice that yourdrive is also being burnt as well. Hope you were using an OLD CD drive that you didn''t care about!</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge!!! Extremely cerative and clever. I notice that yourdrive is also being burnt as well. Hope you were using an OLD CD drive that you didn''t care about!', '2004-03-07 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(613255, 62721, 13390, '<td valign="top">What ever happened to that "let''s not become arsons now" thing? I LOVE this shot!! You captured the essence of fire in all of it''s awesome glory! Good job, my highest rated shot in the challenge! Good Luck!!!</td>', 'What ever happened to that "let''s not become arsons now" thing? I LOVE this shot!! You captured the essence of fire in all of it''s awesome glory! Good job, my highest rated shot in the challenge! Good Luck!!!', '2004-03-07 23:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(613257, 62392, 7339, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The blue is very smooth and appealing to my eye. I dont really like the title but understand some people might not get fire without it. Still I like the way you croped it and overall think its a very cool image. I gave it a 6.</td>', 'I like this photo. The blue is very smooth and appealing to my eye. I dont really like the title but understand some people might not get fire without it. Still I like the way you croped it and overall think its a very cool image. I gave it a 6.', '2004-03-07 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(613265, 62583, 13390, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative take on the challenge! I absolutely love this shot.long. I''mnot exactly sure how I feel about the border, but I don''t believe it really detracts from the image in anyway. I love the clarity and I love the humor. Many wishes!<br/>~goinskiing</td>', 'Extremely creative take on the challenge! I absolutely love this shot.long. I''mnot exactly sure how I feel about the border, but I don''t believe it really detracts from the image in anyway. I love the clarity and I love the humor. Many wishes!~goinskiing', '2004-03-07 23:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(613275, 62673, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the challenge.  Well done.', '2004-03-07 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 1);
