(613296, 62595, 8891, '<td valign="top">Big Welcome back with this exquisite shot, Kiwi! Congrats on a very well deserved blue ribbon!</td>', 'Big Welcome back with this exquisite shot, Kiwi! Congrats on a very well deserved blue ribbon!', '2004-03-08 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(613297, 62314, 9906, '<td valign="top">45th place....Hmmmmm.  Well ya got my vote for most underrated of the theme and my pick as a favorite!  Good work.  Keep it up!</td>', '45th place....Hmmmmm.  Well ya got my vote for most underrated of the theme and my pick as a favorite!  Good work.  Keep it up!', '2004-03-08 00:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(613298, 62595, 10170, '<td valign="top">Oh flip, he''s back!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>Congrats mate, another great shot :)</td>', 'Oh flip, he''s back!!!!!!!! Congrats mate, another great shot :)', '2004-03-08 00:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(613299, 62666, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unlike many of the photos for this challenge which were staged, this one is photojournalistic, so I''m glad it did well. It''s a very well done image. Nice capture!</td>', 'Unlike many of the photos for this challenge which were staged, this one is photojournalistic, so I''m glad it did well. It''s a very well done image. Nice capture!', '2004-03-08 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(613307, 62728, 4494, '<td valign="top">John, why did you enter this pic in Fire if in your own words you say "I can''t imagine being able to tie this image to the theme of ''fire'' in any way." ???<br/> <br/>Nice pic but why for this challenge?<br/></td>', 'John, why did you enter this pic in Fire if in your own words you say "I can''t imagine being able to tie this image to the theme of ''fire'' in any way." ??? Nice pic but why for this challenge?', '2004-03-08 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(613309, 62595, 7291, '<td valign="top">Oh great, as if it wasn''t hard enough to get a ribbon around here.  Now we have to compete against Kiwi again.  Great job (as always).  ;)</td>', 'Oh great, as if it wasn''t hard enough to get a ribbon around here.  Now we have to compete against Kiwi again.  Great job (as always).  ;)', '2004-03-08 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(613310, 62323, 4494, '<td valign="top">General, you are tied with Jacko (Mudane challenge) for the Brown Ribbon reward. :)  Did you do it on purpose like he did?</td>', 'General, you are tied with Jacko (Mudane challenge) for the Brown Ribbon reward. :)  Did you do it on purpose like he did?', '2004-03-08 00:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(613333, 62728, 9906, '<td valign="top">I too am curious as to why you would enter this into a challenge that you yourself says it doesn''t fit.<br/> <br/>As to your own criticisms of your shot.  I love the lighting here and the way it draws your eye into the shot!  And as for the twig...  My vote is ''Leave it'', if my vote counts that is...<br/>TC<br/> <br/>Edited:  I read your description again and realized that the lighting was not a criticism, but a comment on what the voters would accept.  Once again though I must say I love the lighting in this one...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-08 00:32:49.</i></td>', 'I too am curious as to why you would enter this into a challenge that you yourself says it doesn''t fit. As to your own criticisms of your shot.  I love the lighting here and the way it draws your eye into the shot!  And as for the twig...  My vote is ''Leave it'', if my vote counts that is...TC Edited:  I read your description again and realized that the lighting was not a criticism, but a comment on what the voters would accept.  Once again though I must say I love the lighting in this one...', '2004-03-08 00:28:49.000000', '2004-03-08 00:32:49.000000', 0),
(613334, 62728, 15305, '<td valign="top">If you''re trying to get a Brown Ribbon, as Jacko did... It''ll be very difficult. Your photographs are too good despite the obvious not meeting the challenge.<br/>However, if you''re trying to make a statement.... I''d love to hear it.</td>', 'If you''re trying to get a Brown Ribbon, as Jacko did... It''ll be very difficult. Your photographs are too good despite the obvious not meeting the challenge.However, if you''re trying to make a statement.... I''d love to hear it.', '2004-03-08 00:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(613343, 62728, 12268, '<td valign="top">ditto as the other post challenge comments.<br/>This is obviously a great shot, no doubt about that. No doubt also, by your admission, that it does not meet the challenge. I have to admit I was astounded to see it was yours. Never thought I''d see a shot by you anywhere other than the top. <br/>I like your explanation of the shot. Very methodical &amp; intentional which I think speaks volumes to your fotographic talent &amp; ablities. <br/>Will you hit us back as to why you chose to enter in a challenge that it didnt fit in or are we being a tad nosey?</td>', 'ditto as the other post challenge comments.This is obviously a great shot, no doubt about that. No doubt also, by your admission, that it does not meet the challenge. I have to admit I was astounded to see it was yours. Never thought I''d see a shot by you anywhere other than the top. I like your explanation of the shot. Very methodical & intentional which I think speaks volumes to your fotographic talent & ablities. Will you hit us back as to why you chose to enter in a challenge that it didnt fit in or are we being a tad nosey?', '2004-03-08 00:39:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(613351, 62728, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot. The only way that I could imagine it being related to fire was the way the water was frozen in time, it kind of looks like the gaseous state of smoke. Gave you a "7" simply because its a very good shot.</td>', 'Incredible shot. The only way that I could imagine it being related to fire was the way the water was frozen in time, it kind of looks like the gaseous state of smoke. Gave you a "7" simply because its a very good shot.', '2004-03-08 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 0),
