(613534, 62415, 16957, '<td valign="top">Too bad this didn''t do better. Voting is as much about popularity as about technical and creative excellence. As zeuszen says this is myth-making. Love it.</td>', 'Too bad this didn''t do better. Voting is as much about popularity as about technical and creative excellence. As zeuszen says this is myth-making. Love it.', '2004-03-08 05:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
