(613536, 62475, 14603, '<td valign="top">I should have known !!!<br/> <br/>This was a 9 from me as it was very similar to the shot I was thinking of submitting.<br/>Unfortunately, people don`t seem to relish industrial shots :(<br/>Great stuff Ed.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'I should have known !!! This was a 9 from me as it was very similar to the shot I was thinking of submitting.Unfortunately, people don`t seem to relish industrial shots :(Great stuff Ed. Gordon', '2004-03-08 05:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
