(614875, 62475, 5792, '<td valign="top">Just want to tell you that this was one of my top three picks for this challenge.<br/> <br/>My other two choices finished 1st and 2nd. Sometimes voters miss the mark and I think they did in this case. <br/> <br/>The reasons I like it is that it is a good silhouette, the fire itself is not over exposed, it is very well composed and the grainy clouds and overall dark and morose appearance is perfect for an industrial shot. It is high quality. Congrats on a great shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-10 20:43:55.</i></td>', 'Just want to tell you that this was one of my top three picks for this challenge. My other two choices finished 1st and 2nd. Sometimes voters miss the mark and I think they did in this case.  The reasons I like it is that it is a good silhouette, the fire itself is not over exposed, it is very well composed and the grainy clouds and overall dark and morose appearance is perfect for an industrial shot. It is high quality. Congrats on a great shot.', '2004-03-09 02:27:17.000000', '2004-03-10 20:43:55.000000', 0),
