(617767, 62392, 16672, '<td valign="top">Eek Gats! A black Sun Hole with blue strides of light shooting from its center. Run Run Run for your lives the black hole will suck you in don''t stare to long or you''ll go blind from the radiation.<br/> <br/>My biggest concern is why the border? Its disrupting to the image especially if you put it on a white back ground printed with that black border.</td>', 'Eek Gats! A black Sun Hole with blue strides of light shooting from its center. Run Run Run for your lives the black hole will suck you in don''t stare to long or you''ll go blind from the radiation. My biggest concern is why the border? Its disrupting to the image especially if you put it on a white back ground printed with that black border.', '2004-03-11 07:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
