(617951, 62643, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Mona :)<br/> <br/>Fire is such a curious thing to me.  It''s fun to watch it dance.  The dance changes as the flames consume their prey.  Their shapes and textures are in a constant state of change.  Their dances are mesmerising and they radiate a passion and warmth to the audience.  I find the sight and sounds of fire to be relaxing in a way.  Sometimes, the aromas, coupled with the visual stimulation, are just what I need as company on a winter night.  <br/> <br/>Beautiful photo :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Mona :) Fire is such a curious thing to me.  It''s fun to watch it dance.  The dance changes as the flames consume their prey.  Their shapes and textures are in a constant state of change.  Their dances are mesmerising and they radiate a passion and warmth to the audience.  I find the sight and sounds of fire to be relaxing in a way.  Sometimes, the aromas, coupled with the visual stimulation, are just what I need as company on a winter night.   Beautiful photo :) ', '2004-03-11 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
